WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.350
It’s an Earthbound Immortal!

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.300
A spider geoglyph monster…

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.010
Will Satellite be destroyed?

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:17.310
I flip over my trap card!

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.570
Altar of the Bound Deity!

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:22.440
Once a turn during my Standby Phase,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:29.550
it gains one Earthbound Immortal Counter for every 
face-up defense position monster card on the field.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:38.020
When it has four counters, I can Special 
Summon one Earthbound Immortal monster from my deck!

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.720
Earthbound Immortal!

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:43.270
That's the card that damaged Yusei’s soul.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:48.810
It's the terrifying card that absorbs 
people's souls trapped inside the geoglyph.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:51.640
I’m scared!

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.500
Their souls will be...

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:58.160
I have to win before he summons 
an Earthbound Immortal.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.720
That's the only way to save those two kids.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.640
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:25.740
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:30.650
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:35.420
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.780
No matter how bad today is

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.770
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:51.170
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:55.230
Is light it myself

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:00.240
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:05.210
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:11.510
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:15.490
Today will never exist again

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:21.390
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:50.330
The Truth From 17 Years 
AgoDark Signer's Hidden Trap

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.320
Jun, Mitchan…

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.530
Takuya…

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.260
Jun, Mitchan...

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.260
Where did you go?

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:33.170
When four counters are lit, the Earthbound 
Immortal appears, and their souls will be absorbed.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.730
I have to finish the duel 
before that happens.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:40.970
My turn.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.100
I activate Altar of the Bound Deity's effect!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:52.740
For every monster in defense position on the 
field, one Earthbound Immortal Counter lights up.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:56.300
I summon Ground Spider in defense position!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.910
This is bad.  It's another 
monster in defense position.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:08.320
At this rate, he'll have three Earthbound 
Immortal Counters on his next turn.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:15.150
I set one card and end my turn!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:16.900
Yusei…

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.560
My turn!

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.720
I have to decrease the number of monsters in 
defense position before his Standby Phase.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:27.350
But even if I attack and destroy, 
my monster will be caught

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.450
in this Spider Web and 
switch to defense position.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.840
Even so...

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.890
I activate Road Warrior’s monster effect!

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:39.220
Once a turn, I can summon a Level 
1 or 2 monster from my deck!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.930
Come, Speed Warrior!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.790
Ground Spider’s effect activates!

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.770
What?

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.920
When Ground Spider is in defense position,

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:55.720
it can switch a monster summoned in 
attack position to defense position!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.490
Spider Hold!

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:11.930
If this situation doesn't change, all 
counters will be lit on the opponent's turn.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.930
I activate the spell card 
Advance Draw from my hand!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:27.340
By releasing one Level 8-or-above monster 
on my field, I get to draw two cards.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:38.520
You’re willing to sacrifice Road Warrior in 
order to have fewer monsters in defense position.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.900
But one monster won't change anything!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:47.620
Then I release a Warrior-Type monster on 
my field to Special Summon Turret Warrior!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:58.800
Turret Warrior gains attack points equal 
to the released monster's attack points!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:09.000
Now only one counter will light up next turn!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:13.150
Ground Spider’s effect can 
only be used once per turn.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:16.050
Turret Warrior remains in attack position!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.800
Turret Warrior attacks Ground Spider!

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.530
Revolving Shot!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.940
Due to Spider Web’s effect, the monster 
that attacked switches to defense position.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:37.640
And it can't change battle 
position until your second turn.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.310
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:47.650
Yusei managed to prevent him from summoning 
an Earthbound Immortal on his next turn.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.790
Yusei is amazing.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.210
This is…  I get it.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:07:00.330
This is the flaming geoglyph 
that Yusei was talking about!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.060
Where are the children?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.410
Yusei...

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.260
There they are!

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.690
This is bad.  The children 
are inside the geoglyph.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.830
Martha!  Ushio!

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.910
An Earthbound Immortal may be summoned soon!

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:28.500
If it does, those children 
will be sacrificed!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.790
What?

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.050
That's horrible!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:35.860
Yusei!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:40.430
Don’t mess around!  Rescue the children!

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:49.870
My turn!  There's one monster in 
defense position on the field.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:56.040
You survived using various 
strategies, but it's all over.

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.060
I flip over my trap card!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.060
I activate Offerings to the Bound Deity!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:07.210
By halving my life points, I can light 
up two Earthbound Immortal Counters.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.130
What?

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:11.050
No way!  After he did all that 
work to prevent it from happening!

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.810
Now there are four Earthbound 
Immortal Counters!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.420
What's that fog?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:37.140
The black cloud wraps around 
Satellite, absorbing many souls.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.470
I sacrifice those souls!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:45.670
No!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.500
Jun!  Mitchan!

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:52.680
I couldn't do anything against 
an Earthbound Immortal again!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:57.320
Earthbound Immortals are nothing special!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.040
Jack!

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.180
Jack!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.220
Jack, the children!

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:08.160
Leave it to me!  Jack Atlas 
never betrays his young fans!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.830
Jack, thank you!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.710
That was close.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.030
What a joke.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:37.320
Now descend, Earthbound Immortal Uru!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.560
What is it?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:47.680
Jack!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.690
It’s here.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:57.640
This is…

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.640
Earthbound Immortal…

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:08.520
That’s…

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:16.130
Yusei!  Hurry up and crush that Dark Signer!

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.390
I will, no matter what.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:24.560
That’s easier said than done.  How 
will you crush an Earthbound Immortal?

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:29.000
Its effect is the greatest.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.820
Just like Moment, the ultimate energy.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:35.750
What are you talking about?

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.190
I’m having fun.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:43.860
After five thousand years, my dueling 
opponent is Professor Fudo’s son.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.260
Professor Fudo…  You know my father?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.900
I do.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:54.270
17 years ago, I was with your 
father Professor Fudo at MIDS,

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:58.270
the Moment development section 
that he was in charge of.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.790
I was Professor Fudo’s assistant.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.210
What?

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:05.450
And there was one other assistant.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:09.180
That person was my younger 
brother Rex Godwin.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.320
I'll tell you one last thing.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:33.050
Professor Fudo proposed stopping 
development on Moment.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:41.420
He was worried that a terrible accident 
might occur because Moment frequent spun backwards.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.350
However, sponsors and Neo Domino 
City wouldn’t allow him.

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:48.000
So development was passed down to me.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:52.030
And then Zero Reverse occurred.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:56.310
What?  Are you saying that the 
explosion was intentional?

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:58.000
Maybe.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:03.030
No way…

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.020
Answer me!  Why would you do that?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:13.490
What happened between my 
father, Godwin and you?

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:18.660
There’s not enough time remaining 
for you to answer that question.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.390
Earthbound Immortal Uru!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:26.370
Earthbound Immortal Uru 
can attack you directly!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:30.190
You'll be defeated in a single blow, Yusei!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.830
Take this!  Hell Thread!

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.570
I flip over my trap card!  Iron Resolve!

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:42.440
By halving my life points, battle damage 
becomes 0, and the Battle Phase ends!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.310
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:54.320
What?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.300
Martha!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.750
Thank you!

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:02.970
That's Takuya's voice!

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.730
Takuya is on the roof?

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.040
Takuya!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.710
Takuya!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.140
Martha!  Ushio!

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.460
This is bad!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:20.720
I’m coming!

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.670
Martha!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:24.310
Martha!

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.780
Martha!

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.030
Takuya!

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:32.760
I’m sorry.  I just wanted to help.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:38.760
It’s fine.  You can’t join 
Security if you don’t have courage.

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:40.000
Let’s go!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.230
Martha!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.670
Martha!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.340
Go, Takuya!

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.580
Martha!

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.290
Martha!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.540
Martha!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.490
Martha!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.060
Don’t give up!

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:17.000
Take care of Takuya.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.370
Because you’re Takuya’s hero.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.040
I’m no hero.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.620
I…  I…

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:28.300
I looked down on you and 
everyone else in Satellite.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:29.880
Martha!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.110
Martha!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:35.630
You were good kids.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:42.370
You'll become the bridge that 
links Satellite with the City.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.440
Martha!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.030
Martha!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.710
Martha!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.750
Martha...

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.100
Martha!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.650
Ushio!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.490
Damn!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:17.520
Martha!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.330
Yusei!  Hurry up and defeat 
the Earthbound Immortal!

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:24.730
Yusei, Ushio and Takuya are in danger!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:30.110
Yusei, we’ll be fine!  So 
hurry up and win the duel!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.820
I’m counting on you, Ushio!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.880
You provide entertainment in unexpected ways.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:39.020
I won’t forgive you…

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:42.320
I'll never forgive you!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.930
My turn!

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:47.010
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.030
Since Junk Synchron was 
successfully summoned,

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:57.130
I can Special Summon Turbo 
Booster from my graveyard!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:04.880
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 5 Turret Warrior!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:10.250
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.950
Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.510
Synchro Summon!

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.190
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:22.480
Stardust Dragon!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.440
All right, let's go.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:32.150
Uru has 3000 attack points.  Your 
low attack points aren’t enough.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:37.660
My feelings towards Martha and 
my friends are part of this duel!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.880
I will defeat you!

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.660
Attack, Stardust Dragon!

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:51.030
What?

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:54.560
You said that Earthbound Immortal 
has the strongest monster effect.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.860
Its monster effect negates spells and traps, 
and it cannot be the target of attack.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.830
You…

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:07.700
If it can’t be the target of attack, 
then the only remaining target is you!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.400
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:17.060
I flip over my trap card!  Spider Egg!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.340
This effect negates your attack!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:25.920
Then it Special Summons three Spider Tokens!

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.010
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:41.080
We made it, Yusei!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.870
The only thing left to do is defeat you!

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:47.620
Oh really?

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.280
Rally!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.800
Rally?

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.960
What's going on?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.380
Rally!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:13.020
How ironic.  You still have another 
friend that you need to save.

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:16.110
How dare you control Rally!

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:20.810
I've just now freed him from my control.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:26.050
If he wants to win, then fight.  
If he wants to lose, then lose.

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:29.640
However, surrendering is 
not allowed in this duel.

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:32.060
Now kid, do whatever you want!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.760
What do you mean?

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:39.360
Yusei, whoever loses this 
duel will be terminated.

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:40.830
What?

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:45.850
Because of him, Blitz, 
Taka and Nerve are gone.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.000
How dare you!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.020
My turn!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.840
Don’t do it, Rally!

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:57.590
You have to fight if you want to live.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:01.990
Earthbound Immortal Uru’s effect!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:09.670
I release one monster on my field to gain 
control of one monster on your field.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.600
I summon Turbo Rocket!

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:25.540
Don't do it, Rally!  Attack and defeat me!

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:26.640
No!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:32.050
Yusei, you’re Satellite’s only hope!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.410
That’s why…

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.820
Don’t, Rally!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:35.610
Rally!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:42.030
Level 2 Turbo Rocket tunes 
Level 1 Turbo Booster.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:44.010
Synchro Summon!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.550
Turbo Booster Cannon!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.530
Is he planning to...

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.520
Don’t do it, Rally!

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:56.570
Turbo Booster Cannon’s effect.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:20:02.980
I destroy one monster on the field, 
and the controller of that monster

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.980
takes damage equal to its attack points.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:07.930
Rally!

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:13.000
I’m sorry, Yusei.  This is all I can do…

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:19.010
The monster I select is 
Earthbound Immortal Uru!

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:28.230
Final Shot!

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:37.520
Rally!

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:39.680
Rally!

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:46.680
Yusei, protect Satellite.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.620
Rally!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.610
Yusei!

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.080
That was interesting.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:11.760
The real battle between the Dark Signers 
and the Signers is just getting started.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:15.290
Each battle will be determined 
by the star of destiny.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:16.640
Star of destiny?

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:21.890
Yusei, you shouldn't think that you 
conquered your fear of Earthbound Immortals.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:26.330
There’s still plenty of fear remaining.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.410
Such as fear towards me.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.100
Yeah, I’m scared.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:39.110
I’m scared of my own 
anger!  I will defeat you!

00:21:56.980 --> 00:22:01.450
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:06.520
We will build our own future

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:11.960
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:17.130
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:32.270
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:37.840
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:42.550
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:47.820
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:52.290
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:57.870
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:02.680
This journey has no end

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:08.210
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:13.450
Hear my voice
